  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nDuring your Main Phase: You can return this
    card to the Extra Deck, then you can add 1 Level 7 Pendulum Monster from your
    Deck or face-up Extra Deck to your hand. You can only use this effect of \"Master
    Spirit Tech Force - Pendulum Ruler\" once per turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \n1
    Level 7 or higher Pendulum Monster + 1 Pendulum Monster\r\nCannot be destroyed
    by card effects. Your opponent's monsters cannot attack, except Pendulum Monsters
    without a Level. You can Tribute 1 monster, then target 1 card your opponent
    controls; destroy it, and if you do, inflict 1600 damage to your opponent. You
    can only use this effect of \"Master Spirit Tech Force - Pendulum Ruler\" twice
    per turn. Once per turn: You can place this card in your Pendulum Zone."
